@page "/clockrx"

<PageTitle>Clock Rx Simple</PageTitle>

<h1>Clock ReactiveX</h1>

<p>This demonstrates a simple clock based on simple ReactiveX</p>

<div class="clock"><p> @_currentTime.Hours.ToString("D2") : @_currentTime.Minutes.ToString("D2") : @_currentTime.Seconds.ToString("D2") </p></div>